  "summary": "求数组中相邻差恒等于 difference 的最长子序列长度。",
  "insight": "按原顺序扫描 value，以它结尾的最长长度只能接在值 value-difference 的已有子序列之后；哈希表直接保存每个结尾值的最优长度。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "子序列不要求连续",
    "difference 可以为零或负数",
    "同一结尾值重复出现时保留较大长度"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "ending-value-hash-dp",
      "title": "结尾值哈希动态规划",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "由唯一所需前驱值转移当前长度。",
      "steps": [
        "dp 映射结尾值到最长长度，answer=0",
        "扫描 value，length=dp.getOrDefault(value-difference,0)+1",
        "dp[value]=max(dp[value],length)，同步更新 answer，返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/ending-value-hash-dp/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/ending-value-hash-dp/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/ending-value-hash-dp/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
